<section class="section about" id="about"><div class="section-copy"><p class="kicker">ABOUT 1031 CAPEX</p><h2>Clear guidance for every move.</h2><p>1031 CapEx helps real estate investors navigate tax-deferred exchanges with a process built around clarity, timing, and responsive support.</p><p>Whether you are selling, acquiring, or improving investment property, we help you understand the next step and keep your exchange moving forward.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Talk with our team <span>→</span></a></div><div class="about-panel"><p class="panel-label">OUR APPROACH</p><strong>Thoughtful exchange support, from first conversation to closing.</strong><div><span>01</span><p>Experienced guidance</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>Simple, organized coordination</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Investor-first communication</p></div></div></section>

<section class="section services" id="services"><div id="explore"></div><div class="section-heading"><p class="kicker">SERVICES</p><h2>Exchange options for your investment strategy.</h2><p>Choose the exchange structure that fits the timing and goals of your transaction.</p></div><div class="service-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Delayed Exchange</h3><p>The most common 1031 exchange, giving investors flexibility when transitioning between properties.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Reverse Exchange</h3><p>Acquire a replacement property before selling your current property.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Simultaneous Exchange</h3><p>A direct swap of ownership interests between two parties completed at the same time.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Construction Exchange</h3><p>Use capital generated from a sale to make substantial improvements to a replacement asset.</p></article></div></section>

<section class="process" id="process"><div class="section process-inner"><div class="section-heading light"><p class="kicker">THE PROCESS</p><h2>Confident exchanges begin with a clear plan.</h2></div><ol><li><b>01</b><h3>Start the conversation</h3><p>Discuss your current property, plans, and exchange timeline.</p></li><li><b>02</b><h3>Prepare your exchange</h3><p>Put the exchange structure and key documentation in place before closing.</p></li><li><b>03</b><h3>Identify replacement property</h3><p>Track important deadlines and identify your next investment property.</p></li><li><b>04</b><h3>Complete the exchange</h3><p>Coordinate the final purchase to complete your tax-deferred exchange.</p></li></ol></div></section>

<section class="section benefits" id="why"><div class="section-heading"><p class="kicker">WHY CONSIDER A 1031 EXCHANGE?</p><h2>Keep more capital working for you.</h2></div><div class="benefit-grid"><div><span>↗</span><h3>Improve cash flow</h3><p>Reposition into an asset aligned with your investment objectives.</p></div><div><span>◌</span><h3>Grow wealth</h3><p>Continue building your real estate portfolio over time.</p></div><div><span>⌁</span><h3>Defer taxes</h3><p>Potentially defer eligible capital-gains taxes through a properly structured exchange.</p></div><div><span>＋</span><h3>Diversify your portfolio</h3><p>Explore new property types, markets, or investment approaches.</p></div><div><span>↑</span><h3>Increase purchasing power</h3><p>Use more of your sale proceeds toward your replacement property.</p></div><div><span>◇</span><h3>Leverage your investment</h3><p>Move forward with a strategy designed for your next acquisition.</p></div></div><p class="disclaimer">1031 exchange eligibility and tax outcomes depend on your circumstances. Consult qualified legal and tax advisors.</p></section>

<section class="section faq" id="resources"><div class="section-heading"><p class="kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Helpful context before you begin.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details open><summary>What is a 1031 exchange?<span>+</span></summary><p>A 1031 exchange is a tax-deferred real estate transaction that may allow an investor to reinvest proceeds from the sale of qualifying investment property into replacement property.</p></details><details><summary>What are the key deadlines?<span>+</span></summary><p>Timing is an important part of every exchange. Contact the team early in your sale process to discuss your transaction and next steps.</p></details><details><summary>When should I begin planning?<span>+</span></summary><p>Begin before your current property closes. Early planning helps give your exchange the strongest possible foundation.</p></details></div></section>

<section class="contact" id="contact"><div id="start"></div><div><p class="kicker">LET'S GET STARTED</p><h2>Ready to discuss your next exchange?</h2><p>Tell us a little about your transaction and a member of our team will be in touch.</p></div><div class="contact-card"><a href="tel:9495030001"><small>CALL</small><strong>949-503-0001</strong></a><a href="mailto:info@1031capex.com"><small>EMAIL</small><strong>info@1031capex.com</strong></a><a class="contact-button" href="mailto:info@1031capex.com?subject=1031%20Exchange%20Inquiry">Start your exchange <span>→</span></a></div></section>

